  {"id":"own-WB-20","f":"F12","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): Our deck claims this. {C}"},
  {"id":"own-WB-21","f":"F12","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): The pitch version. {C}"},
  {"id":"own-K-00","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} We closed three deals in September."},
  {"id":"own-K-01","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Churn fell last month."},
  {"id":"own-K-02","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} The new office opened on Monday."},
  {"id":"own-K-03","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Theo leads the integration work."},
  {"id":"own-K-04","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Priya joined as head of sales."},
  {"id":"own-K-05","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} The pilot ended last week."},
  {"id":"own-K-06","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Support tickets decreased."},
  {"id":"own-K-07","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} We hired a designer."},
  {"id":"own-K-08","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} The security review passed."},
  {"id":"own-K-09","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Onboarding is on track."},
  {"id":"own-K-10","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} The board approved the budget."},
  {"id":"own-K-11","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Our NPS improved."},
  {"id":"own-K-12","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} We renewed the warehouse lease."},
  {"id":"own-K-13","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Thanks for joining."},
  {"id":"own-K-14","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Good afternoon everyone."},
  {"id":"own-K-15","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Moving on."},
  {"id":"own-K-16","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} That is final."},
  {"id":"own-K-17","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} The date is firm."},
  {"id":"own-K-18","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} We committed to it with the board."},
  {"id":"own-K-19","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Engineering started the work."},
  {"id":"own-K-20","f":"F13","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} The spec is approved."},
  {"id":"own-FW-00","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Our engineers would laugh at that."},
  {"id":"own-FW-01","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Again, ballpark."},
  {"id":"own-FW-02","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Assuming hiring goes to plan."},
  {"id":"own-FW-03","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Sales wants it sooner, engineering wants it later."},
  {"id":"own-FW-04","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Unless the carrier backs out."},
  {"id":"own-FW-05","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Theo is less confident."},
  {"id":"own-FW-06","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} We have a fallback."},
  {"id":"own-FW-07","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} There's a backup plan if it slides."},
  {"id":"own-FW-08","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} That's me being bullish."},
  {"id":"own-FW-09","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} It's a coin flip."},
  {"id":"own-FW-10","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Fifty-fifty, really."},
  {"id":"own-FW-11","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Take it with a pinch of salt."},
  {"id":"own-FW-12","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Odds are decent."},
  {"id":"own-FW-13","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} I'd say sixty percent."},
  {"id":"own-FW-14","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} There's a real chance it moves."},
  {"id":"own-FW-15","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} It could easily be February."},
  {"id":"own-FW-16","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} February at the latest."},
  {"id":"own-FW-17","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Worst case February."},
  {"id":"own-FW-18","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Engineering hasn't scoped it."},
  {"id":"own-FW-19","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} We haven't hired the team for it."},
  {"id":"own-FW-20","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Nobody's working on it yet."},
  {"id":"own-FW-21","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} The partner contract is unsigned."},
  {"id":"own-FW-22","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Legal is reviewing the partner terms."},
  {"id":"own-FW-23","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} This is aspirational."},
  {"id":"own-FW-24","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} We tend to slip."},
  {"id":"own-FW-25","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Every launch this year ran late."},
  {"id":"own-FW-26","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Our track record says otherwise."},
  {"id":"own-FW-27","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Don't write that down."},
  {"id":"own-FW-28","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Leave that out of the update."},
  {"id":"own-FW-29","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Investors don't need to hear it yet."},
  {"id":"own-FW-30","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Let's call that tentative."},
  {"id":"own-FW-31","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Hmm."},
  {"id":"own-FW-32","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Okay, maybe."},
  {"id":"own-FW-33","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Sort of."},
  {"id":"own-FW-34","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Who knows."},
  {"id":"own-FW-35","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Time will tell."},
  {"id":"own-FW-36","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} We'll know after the board meeting."},
  {"id":"own-FW-37","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} That's the external story."},
  {"id":"own-FW-38","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Internally we say March."},
  {"id":"own-FW-39","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Off by a month either way."},
  {"id":"own-FW-40","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Plus or minus a few weeks."},
  {"id":"own-FW-41","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} In a good month."},
  {"id":"own-FW-42","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} With luck."},
  {"id":"own-FW-43","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Big asterisk."},
  {"id":"own-FW-44","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} As usual."},
  {"id":"own-FW-45","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Classic us."},
  {"id":"own-FW-46","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Famous last words, I know."},
  {"id":"own-FW-47","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Yeah right."},
  {"id":"own-FW-48","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} I'm being sarcastic."},
  {"id":"own-FW-49","f":"F14","e":"w","r":"context","t":"T02","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} Obviously not literally."},
  {"id":"own-FK-00","f":"F15","e":"k","n":"Maren (CEO): {C} We closed the Series A in July."},
